<title>USA: Union Pacific completes Resources spinoff.</title>
<headline>Union Pacific completes Resources spinoff.</headline>
<dateline>BETHLEHEM, Penn. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Pacific Corp said on Wednesday that it completed its previously announced pro-rata, tax-free spinoff of all remaining Union Pacific Resources Group Inc stock to its shareholders.</p>
<p>The company said shareholders of record on September 26 would receive 0.846946 of a share of Union Pacific Resources common stock for each Union Pacific share held.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
